## Import

Alert routes can be imported using the format `cluster_type/cluster_name/integration_type/route_type`:

```shell
terraform import axonops_alert_route.example cassandra/my-cluster/slack/metrics
```

Where:
- `cluster_type` - The type of cluster (cassandra, kafka, or dse)
- `cluster_name` - The name of the cluster
- `integration_type` - The integration type (slack, pagerduty, email, teams, servicenow, webhook, opsgenie)
- `route_type` - The route type (global, metrics, backups, servicechecks, nodes, commands, repairs, rollingrestart)
